Notes
=====
 This is a "null record", readable by any application built using WFDB library
 version 9.1 or later.  There are no signal files associated with this
 record (the `*' in the signal specification lines above has no special
 significance).  If read, this record appears to have 1800 samples (5 seconds
 at 360 Hz) in each of two signals, and all samples are zero.  If this record
 is used as a template for output (e.g., using osigopen("null", ...)), any
 samples "written" using putvec() are discarded.
